"P2_TOOL_CLOTH": "Soft cloth",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH": "Coarse brush",
"P2_TOOL_WATER": "Water bottle",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER": "Mara 1's spanner",
"P2_TOOL_INTRO": "There you are, my lady! I'll handle the high ones. Could you take these three lower panes?",
"P2_TOOL_GUIDE": "Pick the soft cloth and work down from the dust at the top. No spanners. I nearly tried that myself.",
"P2_TOOL_ALREADY": "This window is already clean.",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER_FEEDBACK": "The spanner cannot clean the window. Mara 1 hastily reaches out.",
"P2_TOOL_SPANNER_LINE": "Clean with that and you'll open the wall before the window. The cloth, please. The cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH_FEEDBACK": "The coarse brush spread the dust sideways. The soft cloth can clear it right away.",
"P2_TOOL_BRUSH_LINE": "My lady, the soft cloth, not that brush! Just gather the scattered dust again, starting at the top.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_STAIN": "The water loosened the stain. Wipe the moisture below with the dry side of the soft cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_BOTTOM": "The clean lower area is wet again. Use the dry side of the soft cloth.",
"P2_TOOL_WATER_WRONG": "Water only smears the dirt while dust remains. Clear the dust at the top first.",
"P2_TOOL_TOP_CLEAN": "I gathered the dust downward and cleared the top.",
"P2_TOOL_BIRD": "The same bird crosses the window again, with the same wingbeats.",
"P2_TOOL_BIRD_LINE": "You take your time, but you've got sharp eyes. Don't try wiping that bird away too. ...Just kidding. Probably.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_ORDER": "Starting lower down made dust fall from above again. Work from top to bottom.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_CLEAN": "I wiped away the middle stain in circles.",
"P2_TOOL_MIDDLE_ALREADY": "The middle is already clean.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_ORDER": "Starting at the bottom made dirt fall from above again. Work from top to bottom.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_CLEAN": "I wiped away the moisture below with the soft cloth's dry side.",
"P2_TOOL_BOTTOM_ALREADY": "The bottom is already dry.",
"P2_TOOL_INVALID": "This item cannot be used to clean windows.",
"P2_TOOL_COMPLETE_LINE": "Spotless! Keep this up and I'll only complain half as much about being short-handed.",
